{
  "id": 29,
  "type": "pages",
  "link": "https://rebooth.co.jp/works-top/",
  "title": "Results",
  "content_html": "<main class=\"p-page\">\n  <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n    <ul class=\"c-breadcrumb\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\"><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a itemprop=\"item\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp\"><span itemprop=\"name\" >HOME</span></a><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"1\" /></li><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Results</span><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"2\" /></li></ul>  </div>\n  <section class=\"p-page__header\">\n    <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n      <div class=\"p-page__title c-title-sec\">\n        <p class=\"c-text--en js-split\">\n          works\n        </p>\n        <h1 class=\"c-text--ja p-page__title--fade\">Results</h1>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n                          <div class=\"p-page__thumbnail\">\n          <div class=\"u-media g-thumbnail\">\n            <img src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/works.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n            </section>\n  <div class=\"wp_block-content wp_block-content-fluid\">\n    \n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box alignwide is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-decorated-top\">Environmentally Conscious<br>SDGs Exhibition Booth</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Exhibition booths used at trade shows and exhibitions are typically dismantled and disposed of after the event.<br>These disposable exhibition booths generate a massive amount of waste each year, placing a heavy burden on the environment.<br>Furthermore, sourcing new materials for each exhibition also becomes a financial burden for companies.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-right:0;margin-left:0\">To solve this problem, we manufacture exhibition booths entirely from reusable materials.<br>With this approach, materials can be reused without being discarded after the event, making it possible to significantly reduce waste.<br>Moreover, by utilizing reusable materials, there is no need to procure new materials each time, allowing us to keep production costs down.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This enables companies to realize exhibitions that are both economically efficient and environmentally considerate.<br>By providing environmentally friendly exhibition booths, we support corporate sustainability initiatives and work towards a more sustainable future for the exhibition industry.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-filter-works\">\n  <div class=\"p-filter-works__inner\">\n    <form method=\"get\" action=\"/works/\">\n      \n        <div class=\"p-filter-works__item\">\n          <p class=\"p-filter-works__title\">Number of Booths</p>\n          <div class=\"p-filter-works__check-list\">\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"size-2m-2m\"\n                  name=\"booth_size[]\"\n                  value=\"size-2m-2m\">\n                <label for=\"size-2m-2m\" class=\"c-btn\">2m×2m</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"size-3m-3m\"\n                  name=\"booth_size[]\"\n                  value=\"size-3m-3m\">\n                <label for=\"size-3m-3m\" class=\"c-btn\">3m×3m</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"size-3m-6m\"\n                  name=\"booth_size[]\"\n                  value=\"size-3m-6m\">\n                <label for=\"size-3m-6m\" class=\"c-btn\">3m×6m</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"size-3m-9m\"\n                  name=\"booth_size[]\"\n                  value=\"size-3m-9m\">\n                <label for=\"size-3m-9m\" class=\"c-btn\">3m×9m</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"size-6m-6m\"\n                  name=\"booth_size[]\"\n                  value=\"size-6m-6m\">\n                <label for=\"size-6m-6m\" class=\"c-btn\">6m×6m</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"size-other\"\n                  name=\"booth_size[]\"\n                  value=\"size-other\">\n                <label for=\"size-other\" class=\"c-btn\">Other</label>\n              </span>\n                      </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n      \n        <div class=\"p-filter-works__item\">\n          <p class=\"p-filter-works__title\">Industry Type</p>\n          <div class=\"p-filter-works__check-list\">\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"it\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"it\">\n                <label for=\"it\" class=\"c-btn\">IT / Information Services</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"education-affairs-resources\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"education-affairs-resources\">\n                <label for=\"education-affairs-resources\" class=\"c-btn\">Education / General Affairs / Human Resources</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"semiconductor-machine\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"semiconductor-machine\">\n                <label for=\"semiconductor-machine\" class=\"c-btn\">Manufacturing / Semiconductors / Machinery</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"science\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"science\">\n                <label for=\"science\" class=\"c-btn\">Science / Research Institutions</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"medical\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"medical\">\n                <label for=\"medical\" class=\"c-btn\">Medical / Pharmaceutical / Welfare</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"beauty\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"beauty\">\n                <label for=\"beauty\" class=\"c-btn\">Beauty / Cosmetics / Drugstores</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"printing\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"printing\">\n                <label for=\"printing\" class=\"c-btn\">Printing / Publishing</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"goods\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"goods\">\n                <label for=\"goods\" class=\"c-btn\">General Merchandise</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"food\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"food\">\n                <label for=\"food\" class=\"c-btn\">Food &amp; Beverage / Restaurant</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"eco\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"eco\">\n                <label for=\"eco\" class=\"c-btn\">Environment / Eco</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"sports\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"sports\">\n                <label for=\"sports\" class=\"c-btn\">Other</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"agriculture\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"agriculture\">\n                <label for=\"agriculture\" class=\"c-btn\">Agriculture</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"logistics\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"logistics\">\n                <label for=\"logistics\" class=\"c-btn\">Transportation / Traffic / Logistics</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"event\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"event\">\n                <label for=\"event\" class=\"c-btn\">Event / Entertainment / Video</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"finance\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"finance\">\n                <label for=\"finance\" class=\"c-btn\">Finance / Investment</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"real-estate\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"real-estate\">\n                <label for=\"real-estate\" class=\"c-btn\">Real Estate / Construction</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"administration\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"administration\">\n                <label for=\"administration\" class=\"c-btn\">Government Administration</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"industry-other\"\n                  name=\"industry_type[]\"\n                  value=\"industry-other\">\n                <label for=\"industry-other\" class=\"c-btn\">Other</label>\n              </span>\n                      </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n      \n        <div class=\"p-filter-works__item\">\n          <p class=\"p-filter-works__title\">Price</p>\n          <div class=\"p-filter-works__check-list\">\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"price-50-100\"\n                  name=\"price_range[]\"\n                  value=\"price-50-100\">\n                <label for=\"price-50-100\" class=\"c-btn\">500,000 to 1,000,000 yen</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"price-100-200\"\n                  name=\"price_range[]\"\n                  value=\"price-100-200\">\n                <label for=\"price-100-200\" class=\"c-btn\">1,000,000 to 2,000,000 yen</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"price-200-300\"\n                  name=\"price_range[]\"\n                  value=\"price-200-300\">\n                <label for=\"price-200-300\" class=\"c-btn\">2,000,000 to 3,000,000 yen</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"price-300-500\"\n                  name=\"price_range[]\"\n                  value=\"price-300-500\">\n                <label for=\"price-300-500\" class=\"c-btn\">3,000,000 to 5,000,000 yen</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"price-500\"\n                  name=\"price_range[]\"\n                  value=\"price-500\">\n                <label for=\"price-500\" class=\"c-btn\">5,000,000 yen or more</label>\n              </span>\n                      </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n      \n        <div class=\"p-filter-works__item\">\n          <p class=\"p-filter-works__title\">Booth Layout Type</p>\n          <div class=\"p-filter-works__check-list\">\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"layout-1\"\n                  name=\"layout_type[]\"\n                  value=\"layout-1\">\n                <label for=\"layout-1\" class=\"c-btn\">1-side Open</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"layout-2\"\n                  name=\"layout_type[]\"\n                  value=\"layout-2\">\n                <label for=\"layout-2\" class=\"c-btn\">2-side Open</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"layout-3\"\n                  name=\"layout_type[]\"\n                  value=\"layout-3\">\n                <label for=\"layout-3\" class=\"c-btn\">3-side Open</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"layout-4\"\n                  name=\"layout_type[]\"\n                  value=\"layout-4\">\n                <label for=\"layout-4\" class=\"c-btn\">4-side Open</label>\n              </span>\n                      </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n      \n        <div class=\"p-filter-works__item\">\n          <p class=\"p-filter-works__title\">Base Color</p>\n          <div class=\"p-filter-works__check-list\">\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"white\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"white\">\n                <label for=\"white\" class=\"c-btn\">White</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"black\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"black\">\n                <label for=\"black\" class=\"c-btn\">Black</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"blue\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"blue\">\n                <label for=\"blue\" class=\"c-btn\">Blue</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"light-blue\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"light-blue\">\n                <label for=\"light-blue\" class=\"c-btn\">Light Blue</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"navy\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"navy\">\n                <label for=\"navy\" class=\"c-btn\">Navy</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"red\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"red\">\n                <label for=\"red\" class=\"c-btn\">Red</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"yellow\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"yellow\">\n                <label for=\"yellow\" class=\"c-btn\">Yellow</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"orange\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"orange\">\n                <label for=\"orange\" class=\"c-btn\">Orange</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"green\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"green\">\n                <label for=\"green\" class=\"c-btn\">Green</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"pink\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"pink\">\n                <label for=\"pink\" class=\"c-btn\">Pink</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"brown\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"brown\">\n                <label for=\"brown\" class=\"c-btn\">Brown</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"gray\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"gray\">\n                <label for=\"gray\" class=\"c-btn\">Gray</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"ivory\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"ivory\">\n                <label for=\"ivory\" class=\"c-btn\">Ivory</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"purple\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"purple\">\n                <label for=\"purple\" class=\"c-btn\">Purple</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"wood\"\n                  name=\"base_color[]\"\n                  value=\"wood\">\n                <label for=\"wood\" class=\"c-btn\">Wood Grain</label>\n              </span>\n                      </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n      \n        <div class=\"p-filter-works__item\">\n          <p class=\"p-filter-works__title\">Other Decoration Methods</p>\n          <div class=\"p-filter-works__check-list\">\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"fabric\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"fabric\">\n                <label for=\"fabric\" class=\"c-btn\">Fabric (Cloth)</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"counter\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"counter\">\n                <label for=\"counter\" class=\"c-btn\">Counter / Table / Chairs</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"spotlight\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"spotlight\">\n                <label for=\"spotlight\" class=\"c-btn\">Lighting / Spotlights</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"houseplants\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"houseplants\">\n                <label for=\"houseplants\" class=\"c-btn\">Ornamental Plants</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"illuminated-wall\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"illuminated-wall\">\n                <label for=\"illuminated-wall\" class=\"c-btn\">Glowing Wall</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"catalog-stand\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"catalog-stand\">\n                <label for=\"catalog-stand\" class=\"c-btn\">Catalog Stand</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"exhibition\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"exhibition\">\n                <label for=\"exhibition\" class=\"c-btn\">Product Display</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"panel\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"panel\">\n                <label for=\"panel\" class=\"c-btn\">Design Panel</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"monitor\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"monitor\">\n                <label for=\"monitor\" class=\"c-btn\">Monitor</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"channel-sign\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"channel-sign\">\n                <label for=\"channel-sign\" class=\"c-btn\">Logo Signboard</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"meeting-area\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"meeting-area\">\n                <label for=\"meeting-area\" class=\"c-btn\">Meeting Space</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"stage\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"stage\">\n                <label for=\"stage\" class=\"c-btn\">Stage / Tiered Platform</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"logo-box\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"logo-box\">\n                <label for=\"logo-box\" class=\"c-btn\">Display Stand</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"gate\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"gate\">\n                <label for=\"gate\" class=\"c-btn\">Gate</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"backyard\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"backyard\">\n                <label for=\"backyard\" class=\"c-btn\">Backyard</label>\n              </span>\n                          <span class=\"c-btn-check\">\n                <input type=\"checkbox\"\n                  id=\"with-truss\"\n                  name=\"decoration[]\"\n                  value=\"with-truss\">\n                <label for=\"with-truss\" class=\"c-btn\">Truss</label>\n              </span>\n                      </div>\n        </div>\n\n\n            <p class=\"p-filter__count\">Relevant article:<span class=\"js-count\">--</span>result(s)</p>\n      <div class=\"p-filter__buttons\">\n\n        <div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-normal\">\n          <button class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" type=\"reset\">Reset Conditions</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-primary has-arrow-next is-decorated\">\n          <button class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" type=\"submit\">Display Matching Results</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </form>\n    <script src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/themes/rebooth/inc/component/filter-works/filter-works.js\"></script>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n    <section class=\"l-block p-page-works-top\">\n    <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n      <h2 class=\"p-archive-title\">Latest Results</h2>\n              <div class=\"p-archive__list p-works-list\">\n                                   <div class=\"p-archive-list__item g-list-fade-in\">\n               <a class=\"p-works-card\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/works/1538/\">\n                 <div class=\"p-works-card__thumbnail u-media\">\n                                                             <img src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/green-energy-2026-1-1-960x795.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                    </div>\n                 <div class=\"p-works-card__body\">\n                   <h3 class=\"p-works-card__title\">Green Energy &amp; Company Co., Ltd. Exhibition Booth / Sep 2026 / Sustainable Management Week</h3>\n\n                   <div class=\"p-post__cat-list\"><span class=\"p-post__cat\">Environment / Eco</span></div>                 </div>\n               </a>\n             </div>                                   <div class=\"p-archive-list__item g-list-fade-in\">\n               <a class=\"p-works-card\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/works/1275/\">\n                 <div class=\"p-works-card__thumbnail u-media\">\n                                                             <img src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/w2-4-960x521.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                    </div>\n                 <div class=\"p-works-card__body\">\n                   <h3 class=\"p-works-card__title\">W2 Inc. Exhibition Booth / Oct 2026 / EC &amp; Store Week (Japan IT Week)</h3>\n\n                   <div class=\"p-post__cat-list\"><span class=\"p-post__cat\">IT / Information Services</span></div>                 </div>\n               </a>\n             </div>                                   <div class=\"p-archive-list__item g-list-fade-in\">\n               <a class=\"p-works-card\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/works/1267/\">\n                 <div class=\"p-works-card__thumbnail u-media\">\n                                                             <img src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260623_094156-960x501.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                    </div>\n                 <div class=\"p-works-card__body\">\n                   <h3 class=\"p-works-card__title\">Marks Life Co., Ltd. (マークスライフ株式会社) Exhibition Booth / June 2026 /